    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "The wait is almost over! Lady L Cannabis is officially opening our doors at <strong>547 West Side Ave, Jersey City</strong>, and we’re throwing a full-day celebration to mark the occasion. Come join us for food, fun, and festivities right here in the West Side neighborhood."
    },
    {
     "type": "h2",
     "text": "The Celebration"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "We’re kicking things off early across the street at <strong>123Events (next to the library on Lex)</strong> with a lineup of local partners and special experiences:"
    },
    {
     "type": "h4",
     "text": "11AM – 3PM – Early Bites, Bevs and Vibes"
    },
    {
     "type": "ul",
     "items": [
      "🥟 <strong>Eat Em Up Empanadas</strong>: 200 munchie boxes of bite-sized empanadas (one meat + one cheese). Free while supplies last—first come, first serve!",
      "🍋 <strong>Hydrate &amp; Elevate Mocktail Bar</strong>: THC-infused Lavender Lemonade + Uptown Arnold Palmer.",
      "🌈 <strong>Private Aura Photography</strong>: A one-of-a-kind aura photo experience with a personalized reading + guide card. Limited to 40 sessions—first come, first serve!"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h4",
     "text": "5 – 9PM – Evening Fun"
    },
    {
     "type": "ul",
     "items": [
      "🍧 <strong>Rainbow Snow Shaved Ice Truck</strong>: Refreshing, colorful treats.",
      "🚌 <strong>Consumption Bus</strong>: A safe space to relax, consume, and connect."
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "From morning bites to evening vibes, this day is all about celebrating our neighborhood, our community, and the beginning of Lady L’s journey with you."
    },
